    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SeaQuest Dungeon is a fast-paced, twin-stick shooter roguelite. With limited resources, choose different props to create powerful combinations to challenge higher difficulties and unlock new skills and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/0839af874557965c230c7342e765d4ad.webp?t=1753153362\" width=627 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick reaction combat in a small space. The balance between recoil and range, the choice between risk and reward. Movement offsets recoil, higher operating space between sprint moves. The variety of monster attack forms and room traps creates a unique combat experience..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/442c49ea7bef95ee12992a31f86795d2.poster.avif?t=1753153362\" width=626 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/442c49ea7bef95ee12992a31f86795d2.webm?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/442c49ea7bef95ee12992a31f86795d2.mp4?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/c659c66f607a8b2dd191d5b58d59fd6f.webp?t=1753153362\" width=627 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has limited resources provided, and you need to make the optimal choice based on the existing weapons, skills, and props. The difficulty will continue to increase until the boss room is reached. Every choice of room will have various consequences later on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/b3849891a4c69ea6f6004d1b7afba433.avif?t=1753153362\" width=626 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/209c43b6d5f5a1462839ae6c2d460999.poster.avif?t=1753153362\" width=626 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/209c43b6d5f5a1462839ae6c2d460999.webm?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/209c43b6d5f5a1462839ae6c2d460999.mp4?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/5e0abd76b5d195a8756f2dc755b8502c.webp?t=1753153362\" width=627 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, skills, and props can all be used to obtain greater benefits through limited upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/ced8fee77abe4cc2f8e3998c7abde550.poster.avif?t=1753153362\" width=626 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/ced8fee77abe4cc2f8e3998c7abde550.webm?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/ced8fee77abe4cc2f8e3998c7abde550.mp4?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, skills, and props can all be upgraded for a limited number of times to gain greater benefits.Different skills, paired with different weapons, require different strengthening directions, but the limited equipment slots make the selection of props more important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/5801074c742246435d2294bbfa90f96c.poster.avif?t=1753153362\" width=626 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/5801074c742246435d2294bbfa90f96c.webm?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/5801074c742246435d2294bbfa90f96c.mp4?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SeaQuest Dungeon is a fast-paced, twin-stick shooter roguelite. With limited resources, choose different props to create powerful combinations to challenge higher difficulties and unlock new skills and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/0839af874557965c230c7342e765d4ad.webp?t=1753153362\" width=627 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick reaction combat in a small space. The balance between recoil and range, the choice between risk and reward. Movement offsets recoil, higher operating space between sprint moves. The variety of monster attack forms and room traps creates a unique combat experience..</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/442c49ea7bef95ee12992a31f86795d2.poster.avif?t=1753153362\" width=626 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/442c49ea7bef95ee12992a31f86795d2.webm?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/442c49ea7bef95ee12992a31f86795d2.mp4?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/c659c66f607a8b2dd191d5b58d59fd6f.webp?t=1753153362\" width=627 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level has limited resources provided, and you need to make the optimal choice based on the existing weapons, skills, and props. The difficulty will continue to increase until the boss room is reached. Every choice of room will have various consequences later on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/b3849891a4c69ea6f6004d1b7afba433.avif?t=1753153362\" width=626 height=124 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/209c43b6d5f5a1462839ae6c2d460999.poster.avif?t=1753153362\" width=626 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/209c43b6d5f5a1462839ae6c2d460999.webm?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/209c43b6d5f5a1462839ae6c2d460999.mp4?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/5e0abd76b5d195a8756f2dc755b8502c.webp?t=1753153362\" width=627 height=42 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, skills, and props can all be used to obtain greater benefits through limited upgrades. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/ced8fee77abe4cc2f8e3998c7abde550.poster.avif?t=1753153362\" width=626 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/ced8fee77abe4cc2f8e3998c7abde550.webm?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/ced8fee77abe4cc2f8e3998c7abde550.mp4?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons, skills, and props can all be upgraded for a limited number of times to gain greater benefits.Different skills, paired with different weapons, require different strengthening directions, but the limited equipment slots make the selection of props more important.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/5801074c742246435d2294bbfa90f96c.poster.avif?t=1753153362\" width=626 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/5801074c742246435d2294bbfa90f96c.webm?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3157890/extras/5801074c742246435d2294bbfa90f96c.mp4?t=1753153362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
